WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:40.170
Chirico! Chirico Cuvie! Answer me!

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.880
From where dost thou come?
To where dost thou go?

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:47.290
And why, Chirico?

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.960
Who... are you?

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:53.130
What do you want with me?

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:57.380
Who ordered you to come to Uoodo, Chirico?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.880
Who are you?

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:03.000
Are you God?

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.880
I thought God was dead...

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.250
On the plains of Parumis...

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:15.460
In Miyoite sector...

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.420
In the deserts of Oromu...

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.040
Chirico, tell me!

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:29.790
Why are you in this city? Who gave you the order?

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:33.460
God... is dead.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.880
Looks like this won't work.

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.000
Maybe he needs more of the drug.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.210
We've already given him as much as we dare.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.170
Like you, God does not exist in his heart.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.290
Like you, too.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.540
Oh well, there are always the usual methods to try.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:58.630
The Trap

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.920
Stubborn bastard!

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.750
We're beating the life out of him,
and still he won't talk.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:29.130
How much do you think he knows about us?

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.000
Shouldn't we just kill him?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:36.040
No. He can't die until we know why he's here.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.330
But I'll wager the people behind him
will show before too long.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.290
You'd best be careful.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.540
I know!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.380
Hi ho!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:11.250
I-Idiot! Don't scare me like that!
What are you doing here?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:16.710
What are you doing here, sneaking around like this?

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.540
Mind your own business!

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.040
I can be as quiet or as loud as I want to be!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.420
You don't have to hide it.
I know what you're thinking.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:29.920
You're looking for some way to save Chirico.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.040
No comment.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.380
I can tell.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:36.500
Shut up! Now disappear before they find us!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.040
Later.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.250
Hi. How's business?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.080
Oh, same ol', same ol'.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:58.750
Gotcha.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.960
All right! I win!

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:02.830
Here.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.540
What're you doing?

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:29.170
You're choking me! I didn't do anything wrong!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.500
Lemme go!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:39.630
Help!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.880
So, you got it?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.130
The money?

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:53.000
Here ya go.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.080
All right.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.750
Help!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.630
God dammit...

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.170
Excuse me.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.710
Oh man, does it have to rain every night?

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.830
Hey, baby. Wanna drink?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.040
Idiot.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.290
Found you. You're almost impossible to track down!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.250
Hey, can I have a drink over here?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.460
What do I look like, a charity?

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:48.960
Prepare to eat those words.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:55.960
Well, somebody's had some luck.
This is unusual for you.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.790
I sold some info about you.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.670
You what?!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.080
I bought it.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.000
I think we need to talk privately.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.040
Bartender, we need a room.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.210
Okay, what are you after?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.500
What do you mean?

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.080
Don't beat around the bush.

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:37.040
You like taking pictures of police guard towers
and machine gun nests that much?

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.170
Hey, we all got our hobbies.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:40.710
You're after Chirico.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.580
I'm right, aren't I?

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.920
There's nothing else there you want. Am I right?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.210
So what's it to you, Old Man?

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.040
I want in on this job, too.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:55.460
If you let me help you...

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.960
I've got a heavy laser we can use.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.580
A heavy laser. I see.

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:15.380
This is where they're holding him.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:17.500
I bought it from one of the guards.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:21.960
Uh-huh. But why do you want Chirico so bad?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.960
Let's say I'd like him to be my buddy.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:31.290
I don't think you're the type who'd risk his life
going up against the cops just for that.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.920
What's your real reason?

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:38.040
That's it. I just like making friends, that's all.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.540
And I want Chirico to be my partner.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:45.040
The God of Destiny wants him
paired up with me, not you.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.580
Says your god. My god says otherwise.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.210
Gonna sell this info to the cops now?

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:03.960
Please! Let me in on this!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.170
I-I want to help Chirico. Please?

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.170
You've fallen for him, haven't you?

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:17.210
He's cuter than you are.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:21.170
Oh, she's got it bad!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:41.080
I don't understand. What do they want from me?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.500
Here we are. Which way?

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.580
Hold on.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.630
Right, one hundred meters.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.130
Rats! Rats! Ew! Gross!

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.080
How do Chirico's connections look?

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.250
We can't find any.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.710
I see.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.960
If he has nobody backing him...

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.920
We should finish him off?

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.000
Left, fifty meters.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:10.080
They weren't kidding when they said heavy laser.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.630
Just push, Coconna.

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.710
I am!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.210
We'll never get the battery up there.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.210
We're only one hundred meters away now.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.500
The extension cord should handle that.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.170
What do we do?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:37.420
If there's any question of why he's still alive,
then for our own safety we should kill him!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:38.920
We'll do it.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:43.250
Anyone who threatens our existence
must be eliminated.

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.500
Have Chirico shot!

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.330
Open the door. We're moving Chirico.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.630
Our boy's cell is right above us.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.580
Chirico Cuvie! Out!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.420
Looks like I owe you another one.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:40.500
You can pay me back later.
Come on. Can you walk?

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.790
Vanilla, company's coming. Blow the passageway!

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:49.290
Gotcha!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.630
Ow!

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.420
I want a city-wide alert issued!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.210
Don't leave a single blade of grass
unturned in the search!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.790
Come on!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.880
They're looking in the wrong direction.

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.380
Now's our chance!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.290
Any sign of him?

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.130
No.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:06.170
Looks like you were wrong
about no one backing him.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:10.580
Sorry. It didn't look like there was.
But we'll know who they are soon.

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:16.580
There are a lot of people in this city who like slander
and rumor better than their three meals a day.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.040
I see.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.250
Don't worry. We'll get him and his friends.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:27.920
Yes, what is it?

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.790
Ah, I see.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:39.000
We've got a tip. It'll make our job that much easier.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:46.750
Look, I don't care how long you stay here.
You're not taking him.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.460
Are you kidding?! Like hell I'm not!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.330
You're not!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.420
I am!

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:54.130
Who do you think thought up that escape plan?!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.630
Me! Me, that's who!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.920
Jeez, those guys.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.630
All they do is argue about who's taking you.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.540
Sorry! Does it sting? Guess so.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.790
You're really hurt.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:16.290
I don't know who's worse,
the cops or the Boone Family.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:17.670
Honestly!

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:20.540
Jeez, they're all a bunch of creeps.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.210
Yeah, hello?

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:28.420
You know? But how?

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:30.580
Oh, I see.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.420
So, you want Chirico?

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:37.380
But we nearly got killed breaking him out.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.580
A Real Battle match in sector 78?

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.540
Are you kidding?

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.380
We just busted him out of that torture chamber!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.670
He isn't ready! I can't let him-

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:52.500
500 million... For 500 million gildans...

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:58.420
But, I... No, the money doesn't matter.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:05.380
Look, I don't want to do this.
Can't we have two or three days?

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.420
He'll be in better condition.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.250
When is this Real Battle?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.130
And where will it be?

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.750
Do you hear me, Oriya? Sorry. Captain Oriya.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:37.960
Roger, Major. Loud and clear.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.420
So, does it feel good being back on the battlefield?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.790
Yes, sir. Very.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.880
Let's hope you've still got the old stuff.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.290
Just leave this to me.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.460
They're here.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:53.290
There.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.420
Got him!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.420
Chief!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:19.960
Damn him!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.290
Looks like he put some thought into this.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:25.130
I'll teach the little shit to mess up my plans!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:35.380
Chirico?!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.380
Two left.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.460
No fair! This isn't one on one!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.920
No wonder they offered so much money.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.040
Draw his fire!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:27.920
Roger!

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:49.460
I see. That's a dirty trick you pulled on him!

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:54.920
What are you talkin' about? I didn't want him to go.
He's the one who okayed all this.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.920
You could care less.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:58.960
What a mess!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:03.290
See, I told you. My decoy plan worked like a charm!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.460
Ooh, I'm so impressed.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:39.790
His fighting style. His moves.
Where have I seen them before?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.250
They're just like...

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:44.880
Traditional urban combat tactics are useless.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:46.210
Forget them!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:50.540
I'm going to teach you the best and only way
to destroy your enemy.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.710
Form into two-man attack teams.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.830
One man goes out to draw the enemy's fire...
while the other one moves in for the kill.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.540
Never forget that!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.540
Captain! Captain Oriya!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.960
I'm right, aren't I?

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.880
Answer me, Captain Oriya!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.290
You figured it out, Sergeant Cuvie.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.500
Surprised to be hunting your old commander?

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:45.790
Why? Why are you after me?
Why are you trying to kill me?

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.000
Tell me! Why are you trying to kill me?
Captain Oriya!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.130
All right, Captain Oriya. Talk! Why are you after me?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.170
What was that mission all about?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.880
Talk, Captain!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:37.040
Wait! Wait, I'll talk! I'll talk, just don't shoot!

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.130
He's a disgrace.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.750
We're out of options.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:44.290
Open fire! Kill them both!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.790
The mission was...

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.330
We're surrounded!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.080
Did you sell us out again?

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.500
What kind of girl do you think I am?

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.290
That's why I'm asking!

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:24.000
It's a trap.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.290
That matchmaker must have been
working with the cops to set us up.

00:22:44.040 --> 00:22:46.790
As I saw the limousine speed away
through the flames...

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:51.670
I couldn't help thinking...
how incongruous it looked amidst the battle.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
NEXT EPISODE

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:00.460
Is a person's fate ruled by God or chance?

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:04.460
That is the eternal mystery that winds through
the endless corridors of time.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:07.000
But the thing which changed Chirico's destiny...

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:09.380
was something known only as the Prototype.

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.750
The tremors of battle running through
the darkness of Lido

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:15.500
are now reborn in the city of Uoodo.

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:17.500
Next time, "Prototype"

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.830
From inside a jijirium shower,
a beautiful woman smiles.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.330
NEXT EPISODE:

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.330
PROTOTYPE

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.040
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.580
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:55.960
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.420
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:09.670
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:13.170
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:23.080
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:29.420
Brighter than any other light...
